+    Does not create an optimizer or update parameter values. Unselected modules
+    remain in the model/state_dict, but have requires_grad=False and grad=None.
+    In particular a frozen input port cannot be decayed by AdamW on passive data.
+    The module selection is part of the existing config digest/resume contract.
